// The four herb tars - a salamander's ammunition (scripts/hunter_salamander.rs2), made from swamp tar and
// a clean herb with a pestle and mortar (scripts/hunter_tar.rs2). OSRS objs 10142-10145: 377's own swamp
// tar model with each tar's single recolour (HSL 16 -> 16545, 6940, 286, 28, written here as RGB15; the
// source is rawswamppaste's 4228, the same colour). They go in the ammunition slot and carry the ranged
// strength a salamander's Flare hits with - guam +16, marrentill +22, tarromin +31, harralander +49.
// Stackable, not noteable, weightless and worth 3, 1, 1, 1 - all OSRS's, as are the examines.

[guam_tar]
name=Guam tar
desc=A thick, foul-smelling, tar-like substance with a green tinge.
model=obj_swamp_tar
recol1s=4228
recol1d=8487
2dxof=1
2dyof=-22
2dzoom=710
2dyan=148
2dxan=224
cost=3
members=yes
stackable=yes
wearpos=quiver
iop2=Wield
category=salamander_tar
param=rangebonus,16

